WEBVTT

01:41.479 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.630 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 21]

01:51.200 --> 01:52.200
Come, have some more.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.229
Ranran,

01:56.840 --> 01:57.759
the runes you sent

01:57.789 --> 01:59.280
are the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

01:59.840 --> 02:00.920
This is the very formation that the Heavenly Sects

02:00.950 --> 02:02.350
used to kill Mu back then.

02:03.120 --> 02:04.230
Who would dare use this formation

02:04.230 --> 02:05.480
to harm the Mount Wester group?

02:06.150 --> 02:07.640
This formation is intricate and mysterious.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.400
Apart from the sovereigns of the Four Sects

02:09.430 --> 02:10.310
who set up this formation back then,

02:10.520 --> 02:12.240
no one else should be able to master it.

02:19.440 --> 02:20.880
Everyone's technique for writing runes

02:20.910 --> 02:21.750
is slightly different.

02:22.280 --> 02:23.280
If you still have a clear memory

02:23.280 --> 02:24.360
of the runes in the formation,

02:25.040 --> 02:26.920
you might be able to compare the writing techniques

02:27.240 --> 02:28.360
to deduce who's behind this.

02:32.470 --> 02:33.750
There's a folk legend

02:34.800 --> 02:35.910
that those with deep-seated hatred

02:36.200 --> 02:37.520
and overwhelming resentment

02:38.310 --> 02:39.630
have souls that can't disperse after death.

02:40.000 --> 02:40.870
They transform into ghosts

02:41.470 --> 02:42.520
known as Night Fiends.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.750
It's said that Night Fiends claim lives

02:45.750 --> 02:46.870
by killing without a trace.

02:53.960 --> 02:54.680
None of these are it.

02:55.560 --> 02:56.400
Then who could it be

02:56.400 --> 02:57.630
that set up the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation?

03:08.520 --> 03:09.190
It's this one.

03:13.000 --> 03:14.800
[Wu]

03:15.600 --> 03:16.570
Mu Ranwu.

03:20.590 --> 03:22.120
She collaborated with the Heavenly Sects back then

03:22.400 --> 03:23.720
to set up the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation

03:23.750 --> 03:24.560
against Mu Qingge.

03:24.840 --> 03:25.870
Of course she would know how to do it.

03:27.810 --> 03:29.740
If Mu Qingge isn't really Mu Qingge,

03:30.750 --> 03:32.280
she's likely to be...

03:34.470 --> 03:35.520
Someone broke into Consonance Palace.

03:58.310 --> 03:59.000
That's right.

03:59.800 --> 04:01.150
The same rune-writing technique.

04:01.470 --> 04:02.560
I wasn't wrong after all.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.280
The one Master sacrificed himself

04:05.280 --> 04:06.890
to resurrect was not Grandmaster,

04:07.340 --> 04:08.580
but Mu Ranwu, who also disappeared

04:08.750 --> 04:10.030
in the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

04:11.150 --> 04:12.280
Master protected the wrong person!

04:14.910 --> 04:15.520
Master,

04:16.120 --> 04:17.160
I have something to tell you.

04:17.630 --> 04:18.950
It's about Grandmaster's identity.

04:19.160 --> 04:19.870
It's very important!

04:22.920 --> 04:23.560
Master?

04:39.720 --> 04:40.630
Master Mu,

04:41.270 --> 04:42.159
why are you here?

04:43.600 --> 04:44.950
I'm keeping your Master company, of course.

04:46.240 --> 04:47.570
Su Yishui

04:47.600 --> 04:48.870
always says one thing but means another.

04:49.950 --> 04:51.000
He wants to be intimate with me,

04:51.560 --> 04:52.800
yet he's afraid to do so.

04:53.650 --> 04:54.330
Master Mu, you are

04:54.360 --> 04:55.630
a free and transcendent person,

04:56.310 --> 04:57.720
yet now, you move between Mr. Yu

04:57.750 --> 04:58.950
and my Master.

04:59.830 --> 05:01.070
It's truly surprising.

05:01.680 --> 05:03.190
Yu and Shui

05:03.580 --> 05:04.530
both wish I can

05:04.560 --> 05:05.630
spend more time with them.

05:06.630 --> 05:07.870
They don't mind.

05:08.830 --> 05:09.920
It's not your place, youngster,

05:09.950 --> 05:10.800
to gossip about this.

05:13.240 --> 05:13.720
Yes.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.560
If you would stay at Mount Wester,

05:17.240 --> 05:18.870
Master would be overjoyed.

05:20.120 --> 05:21.190
He wouldn't have to keep

05:21.210 --> 05:22.640
the dried longan you made for him,

05:22.920 --> 05:24.040
pining away.

05:25.800 --> 05:27.360
Nor would he need to play every day

05:27.480 --> 05:28.920
your favorite "Moonlit Night"

05:29.240 --> 05:30.190
with no audience.

05:32.070 --> 05:33.240
It's good that you know.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.000
In your Master's heart,

05:35.750 --> 05:36.870
there's no room for anyone else.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.390
So, you don't

05:38.430 --> 05:39.830
even know the name

05:39.870 --> 05:41.000
of your favorite melody?

05:45.560 --> 05:46.360
You're testing me.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.040
When did you find out?

05:55.270 --> 05:56.510
And how did you figure it out?

05:57.480 --> 05:59.270
You've been deceiving Master all along.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.120
Do you dare to admit

06:01.120 --> 06:02.160
who you really are in front of Master?

06:02.800 --> 06:03.600
Who I am

06:04.000 --> 06:04.680
doesn't matter.

06:06.190 --> 06:08.030
What matters is who

06:08.720 --> 06:09.830
Su Yishui believes I am.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.360
Why don't you go tell Su Yishui?

06:13.510 --> 06:14.680
Guess how he'll react.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.720
Don't you know how obsessive

06:17.720 --> 06:18.600
your Master is?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.070
He's guilt-ridden

06:22.120 --> 06:23.190
about Mu Qingge's death

06:23.750 --> 06:24.950
and hates himself to death.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.240
He disabled his core and risked his life

06:27.430 --> 06:28.510
to bring back a life.

06:28.510 --> 06:29.560
How precious it is!

06:30.950 --> 06:31.800
He's only willing

06:32.600 --> 06:33.920
and only wants to believe

06:35.040 --> 06:36.310
that Mu Qingge has returned.

06:38.830 --> 06:40.480
Master wouldn't be so blind.

06:41.040 --> 06:41.630
Is that so?

06:42.950 --> 06:44.390
You think your Master

06:44.740 --> 06:46.110
doesn't see as clearly as you do?

06:47.159 --> 06:49.040
It's just a matter of whether he wants to delve deeper

06:49.680 --> 06:51.159
or if he's willing to believe it.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.390
Some people live their entire lives

06:55.040 --> 06:56.800
preferring to deceive themselves and others.

07:00.310 --> 07:01.630
This wood is one with my heart.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.750
May it always

07:04.390 --> 07:05.830
accompany you.

07:13.310 --> 07:13.950
Give it back to me!

07:14.920 --> 07:15.630
Give what back to you?

07:16.600 --> 07:17.870
The hairpin or your Master?

07:18.630 --> 07:19.730
What right do you have to demand anything?

07:20.680 --> 07:21.360
You...

07:21.480 --> 07:22.160
Xue Ranran!

07:27.830 --> 07:28.410
Master,

07:28.630 --> 07:29.600
you've been deceived by this person.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.040
She's not Mu Qingge, she's...

07:31.070 --> 07:31.600
Nonsense.

07:32.040 --> 07:32.750
Get out now.

07:33.570 --> 07:34.280
This person before us,

07:34.310 --> 07:35.390
from temperament to preferences,

07:35.630 --> 07:36.750
is nothing like Grandmaster.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.040
She doesn't even know

07:38.040 --> 07:39.000
the origin of the dried longan

07:39.310 --> 07:40.430
you have or her own

07:40.430 --> 07:41.000
favorite melody.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.490
Master, do you still believe her?

07:42.750 --> 07:43.680
Why shouldn't I believe her?

07:44.480 --> 07:45.480
She's the one I personally brought back

07:45.510 --> 07:46.560
and watched over for 18 years.

07:47.240 --> 07:48.390
No one knows her better than I do.

07:49.040 --> 07:49.750
Have you finished causing a scene?

07:50.120 --> 07:50.750
Get out now.

08:06.210 --> 08:07.330
How dare you sneak into my room

08:07.360 --> 08:08.270
and mess with my things?

08:09.120 --> 08:10.160
I'm helping you,

08:10.190 --> 08:10.920
Su Yishui.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.560
You're so cruel.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.720
You just went along with it

08:14.830 --> 08:16.160
and used me to drive Xue Ranran away.

08:16.750 --> 08:17.830
Won't you thank me?

08:20.480 --> 08:22.120
It seems you've made up your mind

08:22.120 --> 08:23.070
to stay away from her.

08:27.000 --> 08:28.260
You actually activated the Resentment Liquid!

08:28.390 --> 08:29.160
Aren't you afraid—

08:29.560 --> 08:30.950
I know what you're up to.

08:31.510 --> 08:33.000
You're desperately trying to drive a wedge between Ranran and me

08:33.480 --> 08:34.150
because you want her

08:34.150 --> 08:35.120
to leave the protection of Mount Wester

08:35.270 --> 08:35.870
to your advantage.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.549
But I warn you, Mu Ranwu.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.360
Even if Ranran leaves Mount Wester,

08:39.510 --> 08:40.600
no one will be able to harm her in the slightest.

08:41.320 --> 08:42.240
Especially you.

08:42.600 --> 08:43.960
I'll make you wish you were dead.

08:47.390 --> 08:48.440
This is the antidote to the Resentment Liquid.

08:49.200 --> 08:49.870
After you take it and recover,

08:49.870 --> 08:50.960
get out of Mount Wester immediately.

09:08.600 --> 09:09.440
Su Yishui,

09:10.510 --> 09:11.910
I won't end it like this.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.480
Wait, Immortal Master Mu.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.320
She completed building her Foundation

09:16.440 --> 09:17.200
and she's hard to counter now.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.630
In this new life,

09:18.910 --> 09:19.910
am I still not better than her?

09:21.480 --> 09:21.960
Ranran!

09:24.150 --> 09:24.870
Master, look quickly.

09:29.870 --> 09:30.600
Su Yishui,

09:30.840 --> 09:32.360
your rebellious disciple repeatedly provokes me.

09:32.840 --> 09:34.270
Why don't you punish her properly?

09:34.720 --> 09:35.840
Master, you must have seen it.

09:36.080 --> 09:37.270
Her technique of drawing runes

09:37.440 --> 09:38.080
is the same as the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation

09:38.080 --> 09:39.240
that trapped us.

09:39.510 --> 09:40.510
She's the one who harmed us.

09:40.840 --> 09:42.080
She's not Mu Qingge at all.

09:42.200 --> 09:43.240
She is Mu Ranwu.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.200
Master,

09:45.510 --> 09:46.750
I know this is hard to accept.

09:48.750 --> 09:49.150
But

09:49.170 --> 09:49.930
if you look at Mu Ranwu's

09:49.960 --> 09:50.600
rune-drawing technique,

09:50.630 --> 09:51.720
you'll understand everything.

09:51.960 --> 09:52.390
Enough.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.270
I don't need any proof.

10:00.600 --> 10:02.270
Master, are you still deceiving yourself?

10:04.080 --> 10:04.870
Aren't you leaving yet?

10:12.550 --> 10:13.240
Why?

10:14.210 --> 10:14.880
Master, why

10:14.910 --> 10:15.840
won't you listen to what I'm saying?

10:16.530 --> 10:17.570
Even Mr. Yu has noticed

10:17.600 --> 10:18.600
that this Mu Qingge is off.

10:18.870 --> 10:20.150
How can you not see it?

10:20.550 --> 10:21.480
I am the one who truly understands

10:21.480 --> 10:22.150
Mu Qingge,

10:22.630 --> 10:23.360
not Su Yu.

10:24.630 --> 10:25.840
You must be confused.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.000
She's not just impersonating Mu Qingge.

10:28.320 --> 10:29.910
She even set up the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation,

10:30.150 --> 10:31.600
almost killing all of us.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.320
Because of her,

10:33.670 --> 10:34.840
Xi'er was unconscious for days.

10:35.440 --> 10:37.200
Master, do you still want to blindly protect her?

10:39.360 --> 10:40.030
I don't believe it.

10:41.150 --> 10:42.440
You're not someone

10:43.150 --> 10:44.720
who disregards others' lives.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.960
What do you know about me?

10:49.230 --> 10:50.820
I've always done as I pleased,

10:51.320 --> 10:52.360
without regard for others' lives.

10:53.000 --> 10:53.750
That's not true.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.520
You clearly—

10:55.720 --> 10:56.960
You think you know me well?

10:57.440 --> 10:58.360
You have no idea

10:58.510 --> 10:59.870
what Mu Qingge means to me.

11:00.270 --> 11:01.030
You shouldn't have—

11:01.870 --> 11:03.230
I shouldn't have revealed the truth.

11:04.630 --> 11:06.270
You would rather live in a lie

11:06.630 --> 11:08.030
and be trapped in delusions.

11:08.870 --> 11:09.550
So what?

11:10.870 --> 11:11.750
Who do you think you are

11:11.960 --> 11:12.840
to try to influence me?

11:13.910 --> 11:14.550
Xue Ranran,

11:15.840 --> 11:16.910
as long as you're my disciple,

11:17.630 --> 11:18.720
you must respect me as your master

11:18.750 --> 11:19.550
and follow the path I've set.

11:21.000 --> 11:21.840
If you're unwilling,

11:22.150 --> 11:23.480
you must first have the ability to finish your training.

11:24.240 --> 11:25.550
Otherwise, leaving Mount Wester,

11:26.080 --> 11:27.360
going to the capital,

11:27.360 --> 11:28.360
and seeking some kind of belonging

11:28.630 --> 11:29.630
are all just a dream.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.600
Since you're unable to distinguish right from wrong,

11:36.200 --> 11:37.030
then it's better for me

11:38.000 --> 11:39.030
to not stay on Mount Wester.

11:42.510 --> 11:43.510
Your Golden Core is not formed yet.

11:44.360 --> 11:46.000
You can't even pass through Mount Wester's

11:46.000 --> 11:46.550
Breaking Dawn Formation.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.750
You're not qualified to finish your training.

11:49.840 --> 11:50.440
I will participate

11:50.440 --> 11:51.870
in the Marrow-Cleansing Pool Trial at Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

11:53.030 --> 11:54.240
I will enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.050
I will, in the shortest time possible,

11:56.080 --> 11:56.910
advance and form my core,

11:56.960 --> 11:57.750
and break through the formation.

12:00.960 --> 12:01.510
I will

12:02.250 --> 12:03.050
leave Mount Wester.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.150
Very well.

12:06.270 --> 12:07.270
Elite disciples

12:07.450 --> 12:08.640
from all major Heavenly Sects will participate in

12:08.670 --> 12:09.390
the Trial,

12:10.390 --> 12:11.840
but there's only one spot for the Marrow-Cleansing.

12:12.390 --> 12:13.120
I'd like to see

12:13.120 --> 12:14.000
if you have what it takes.

12:15.120 --> 12:16.480
Don't just talk the talk.

12:17.030 --> 12:18.510
If you can't pass the trial, you'll be a laughingstock.

12:19.840 --> 12:21.030
Master, just wait and see.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.630
I will definitely enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool and advance,

12:24.360 --> 12:26.000
remember everything about the Spirit Spring in the netherworld,

12:26.670 --> 12:28.360
and repay your kindness in my own way.

12:31.440 --> 12:32.000
Then I will...

12:34.000 --> 12:34.670
leave you.

13:04.670 --> 13:05.390
You may leave.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.440
Yes.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.790
The last blockage of the Four-Way Waterways

13:18.550 --> 13:19.460
is on Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

13:20.790 --> 13:21.150
Yes.

13:22.550 --> 13:24.270
Heavenly Meridian Mountain was originally an immortal realm.

13:24.770 --> 13:26.690
Without the collective spiritual power of the Heavenly Ones,

13:26.720 --> 13:27.550
it cannot be accessed.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.510
The upcoming Marrow-Cleansing Conference

13:30.150 --> 13:31.510
is the perfect opportunity to enter Heavenly Meridian Mountain

13:31.840 --> 13:33.150
and clear the waterways.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.270
The Marrow-Cleansing Conference...

13:37.550 --> 13:38.720
Ranran will surely attend, won't she?

13:40.790 --> 13:41.630
Your Highness, are you...

13:42.550 --> 13:43.120
Don't worry.

13:44.270 --> 13:45.870
I know my priorities.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.410
Clearing the Four-Way Waterways

13:48.440 --> 13:49.670
has always been the top priority.

13:56.120 --> 13:57.150
These hands of mine

13:58.790 --> 14:00.600
need to possess even more power

14:02.080 --> 14:04.150
to grasp everything I desire.

14:11.760 --> 14:12.610
I will no longer

14:12.630 --> 14:13.840
hand over opportunities that belong to me

14:13.870 --> 14:15.360
to anyone else.

14:16.510 --> 14:18.120
Are you really going to use this favor

14:18.140 --> 14:19.070
to save your brother?

14:19.320 --> 14:20.360
He is my brother.

14:21.050 --> 14:21.810
Nothing is more important

14:21.840 --> 14:23.030
than his safety.

14:24.750 --> 14:25.120
Okay.

14:26.000 --> 14:26.600
I promise you.

14:29.390 --> 14:31.000
I considered brotherly affection,

14:32.360 --> 14:33.390
only to be repaid with a wolf

14:33.390 --> 14:35.360
that wants to devour and replace me.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.440
My dear second brother...

14:41.850 --> 14:43.210
In order to seize the position of Crown Prince,

14:43.240 --> 14:45.120
he planted a deadly poison in my body.

14:47.270 --> 14:49.120
He truly wants to kill me.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.630
Your Highness,

14:51.390 --> 14:52.630
heaven's will surely favors you.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.390
Indeed.

14:56.130 --> 14:57.450
Sometimes I don't even know

14:57.480 --> 14:58.960
if fate is favoring me

14:58.980 --> 15:00.430
or trying to kill me.

15:08.750 --> 15:09.840
The poison has no cure,

15:10.960 --> 15:12.550
yet I've managed to cling to life until now.

15:14.640 --> 15:16.330
Year after year, I go to the Spirit Lake of Mount Absolute

15:16.360 --> 15:17.320
to suppress the poison and recuperate,

15:17.340 --> 15:18.580
waiting for Qingge to return.

15:19.910 --> 15:22.080
Little did I know, I had already reunited with her.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.240
Now, after all this time,

15:27.270 --> 15:28.630
I've finally confirmed that Ranran is her.

15:30.910 --> 15:32.510
Yet you tell me

15:34.910 --> 15:36.390
that I don't have much time left to live?

15:37.720 --> 15:38.200
The poison

15:38.790 --> 15:40.630
has already entered your heart, veins, and bones.

15:41.390 --> 15:43.150
With a mortal body,

15:43.600 --> 15:44.960
you naturally cannot hold on for much longer.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.360
But once the Four-Way Waterways are cleared,

15:47.630 --> 15:49.030
your years of planning

15:49.600 --> 15:50.600
will surely succeed.

15:51.390 --> 15:53.910
You will attain longevity.

15:58.630 --> 15:59.200
Good.

16:01.270 --> 16:03.670
Only then can I fulfill my lifelong wish:

16:04.670 --> 16:06.080
peace throughout the universe

16:06.910 --> 16:08.270
and my loved one by my side forever.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.240
Then, Your Highness,

16:11.600 --> 16:12.240
what

16:12.790 --> 16:13.670
are your plans for Xue Ranran?

16:17.870 --> 16:19.510
Ranran will return to my side.

16:21.270 --> 16:22.480
I've waited for her for so long.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.480
A little longer won't matter.

16:27.160 --> 16:27.970
At the Marrow-Cleansing Conference,

16:28.000 --> 16:29.750
Su Yishui will surely find a way

16:29.770 --> 16:31.640
to ensure she enters the Marrow-Cleansing Pool smoothly.

16:32.550 --> 16:34.270
Let's discuss this once everything

16:36.080 --> 16:36.720
has settled.

16:38.000 --> 16:38.440
Report!

16:41.270 --> 16:41.720
Your Highness,

16:42.150 --> 16:42.840
she has returned.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.240
She just entered Madam Battle's Palace.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.320
Your Highness says she is not Madam Battle.

16:46.790 --> 16:47.630
Then who is she?

16:47.840 --> 16:48.720
Who else could she be?

16:50.080 --> 16:50.840
She's that

16:50.870 --> 16:51.910
ungrateful wretch,

16:51.930 --> 16:53.690
just like my second brother?

16:55.070 --> 16:56.880
The Mu Ranwu whom Mu Qingge protected

16:56.910 --> 16:59.120
yet got killed by.

16:59.550 --> 17:00.670
I'll arrest her right away.

17:00.790 --> 17:01.390
No need.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.910
Since she dares to return,

17:04.790 --> 17:05.680
I might as well

17:05.680 --> 17:07.240
still treat her as Mu Qingge.

17:08.500 --> 17:10.450
After all, the Heavenly Meridian Mountain can only be

17:10.480 --> 17:12.440
entered by Heavenly Ones eligible for

17:13.530 --> 17:14.160
the Marrow-Cleansing Conference.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.240
I still need her to open

17:17.270 --> 17:18.760
the last waterway.

17:19.960 --> 17:20.920
I'll arrange everything

17:21.440 --> 17:22.240
for you right away.

17:22.680 --> 17:23.720
It's not just about arranging for her

17:23.750 --> 17:24.920
to go to Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

17:26.030 --> 17:27.160
Recently, my third brother

17:27.690 --> 17:28.890
has been hesitant

17:28.920 --> 17:29.680
to make any big moves

17:29.700 --> 17:30.750
because Madam Battle has been around me

17:32.680 --> 17:33.830
Given his temperament,

17:34.720 --> 17:35.720
he won't hold back for long.

17:36.680 --> 17:38.640
He will surely make a move against Madam Battle.

17:43.070 --> 17:44.240
Let her be the target.

17:45.990 --> 17:49.430
[Madam Battle's Palace]

18:07.510 --> 18:08.070
Qingge.

18:18.030 --> 18:19.400
I've just come back

18:19.820 --> 18:21.140
and you're here already.

18:22.750 --> 18:23.790
You're keeping such a close eye on me.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.200
I was very worried about you.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.680
I never wanted you to leave the capital.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.000
I know you love your freedom,

18:32.680 --> 18:34.310
but now the Heavenly Sects can hardly tolerate you.

18:34.640 --> 18:36.200
Wei Jiu also has his eyes on you.

18:37.790 --> 18:38.510
I had no choice but to send

18:38.510 --> 18:39.640
my shadow guard to follow you

18:40.350 --> 18:41.030
to protect you.

18:42.880 --> 18:44.640
Who knew that useless fool would lose track of you.

18:45.590 --> 18:46.960
Fortunately, you returned safely.

18:49.070 --> 18:49.720
I'm fine.

18:50.830 --> 18:52.200
I was just wandering around.

18:53.350 --> 18:55.200
I also gathered some spiritual herbs

18:56.480 --> 18:57.480
to refine pills for His Majesty,

18:58.160 --> 18:59.160
so you won't worry.

19:01.790 --> 19:02.920
You're still the same,

19:04.570 --> 19:05.780
always thinking of me in everything.

19:09.590 --> 19:10.350
But I want you

19:11.200 --> 19:12.350
to think more for yourself.

19:14.790 --> 19:15.550
I understand you.

19:16.680 --> 19:17.720
You're the kind of person who wants to

19:17.750 --> 19:19.240
take control of your own life.

19:21.350 --> 19:22.160
So,

19:23.680 --> 19:24.720
even though I really want to

19:24.720 --> 19:26.550
marry you and bring you into the Eastern Palace immediately,

19:28.550 --> 19:29.790
I don't want to hold you back.

19:35.030 --> 19:36.480
So you don't want to marry me anymore?

19:37.960 --> 19:38.960
How could that be possible?

19:40.440 --> 19:41.750
I'm thinking what you're thinking.

19:43.140 --> 19:43.620
I know

19:43.640 --> 19:45.210
the Heavenly Marrow-Cleansing Conference is about to begin.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.240
To regain your former power,

19:49.360 --> 19:50.450
you must certainly strive for

19:50.480 --> 19:52.030
this opportunity at the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

19:53.110 --> 19:53.610
Right?

19:55.270 --> 19:56.200
Of course.

20:00.270 --> 20:01.070
However, this

20:01.590 --> 20:02.640
is not easy

20:04.400 --> 20:05.350
for me now.

20:08.270 --> 20:08.880
Qingge.

20:11.070 --> 20:12.440
I've already thought of a solution for you.

20:15.320 --> 20:16.080
If you need

20:16.110 --> 20:17.310
top-grade spiritual and magical artifacts

20:17.750 --> 20:18.680
from the Exotic Pavilion,

20:20.110 --> 20:20.920
feel free to take them.

20:22.240 --> 20:23.110
I'll be waiting for you

20:24.030 --> 20:25.030
to fulfill your wishes

20:25.600 --> 20:26.880
and marry me

20:28.030 --> 20:28.920
without any regrets.

20:30.510 --> 20:31.070
How does that sound?

20:32.200 --> 20:32.630
Good.

20:40.550 --> 20:41.070
Ranran.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.550
I smell

20:44.550 --> 20:45.400
something burning.

20:45.650 --> 20:46.800
Looks like you're really anxious

20:46.830 --> 20:47.680
to get to the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

20:49.070 --> 20:49.590
Ranran,

20:50.030 --> 20:51.480
why don't you rest a bit after your practice?

20:51.860 --> 20:53.240
We just went down the mountain to shop

20:53.350 --> 20:54.790
and bought you lots of delicious food.

20:56.480 --> 20:57.880
We also picked up your letter at the mountain gate.

20:58.160 --> 20:58.830
It's from the capital.

21:04.000 --> 21:04.480
Ranran,

21:05.070 --> 21:06.750
I hope you successfully enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.310
When you leave Mount Wester,

21:09.030 --> 21:09.750
come to the capital as promised.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.720
What does the letter say?

21:11.920 --> 21:13.240
Why do you look like you're about to cry?

21:15.110 --> 21:16.200
There's also a gift with the letter.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.030
Master.

21:24.550 --> 21:25.640
These spiritual materials and treasures

21:26.110 --> 21:27.480
are all top-grade collections from the palace.

21:28.000 --> 21:28.750
They can aid in your cultivation.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.960
Self-righteous.

21:34.000 --> 21:35.160
Why must you be like this?

21:35.790 --> 21:36.270
What?

21:37.640 --> 21:39.030
You can't bear to part with his gifts?

21:39.960 --> 21:40.440
Yes.

21:41.550 --> 21:42.880
You wield the Sword of Non-Attachment,

21:43.110 --> 21:44.160
yet you remain trapped in past attachments.

21:44.310 --> 21:45.400
You're becoming more and more unreasonable.

21:46.080 --> 21:47.080
Even if you resent Mr. Yu

21:47.110 --> 21:48.400
because of Grandmaster,

21:48.730 --> 21:49.800
you have no right to dispose of

21:49.830 --> 21:50.960
the gifts my friend gave me.

21:51.310 --> 21:51.830
Next time...

21:53.000 --> 21:53.400
No.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.000
Anyway, you will soon

21:55.400 --> 21:56.310
have no right to interfere anymore.

22:14.030 --> 22:15.510
Is Ranran rebelling?

22:16.720 --> 22:17.960
You're so slow.

22:18.680 --> 22:19.320
Ranran and Master

22:19.350 --> 22:20.270
have been in a cold war for so long.

22:20.960 --> 22:22.280
Haven't you noticed that recently when Ranran cooks,

22:22.310 --> 22:23.440
there's not even a portion for Master?

22:25.550 --> 22:26.350
-Why?
-Why?

22:28.020 --> 22:28.550
Don't ask.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.260
We can't help anyway.

22:34.830 --> 22:36.750
Why do you have to suppress yourself so much?

22:37.590 --> 22:39.510
This will only make you lose everything.

22:40.400 --> 22:41.400
I said

22:42.110 --> 22:43.630
I can help you.

22:53.170 --> 22:53.970
Hey, is it necessary for you

22:54.000 --> 22:55.070
to be so harsh on Ranran?

22:55.690 --> 22:56.690
Didn't you say that after entering

22:56.720 --> 22:57.680
the Marrow-Cleansing Pool and forming

22:57.980 --> 22:58.850
the Golden Core, she can live

22:58.880 --> 22:59.480
how she wants?

23:00.200 --> 23:01.480
Even if she wants to go to the capital

23:01.550 --> 23:02.440
and mingle with Su Yu,

23:02.480 --> 23:03.310
you can't control her.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.680
I, Su Yishui, am not a good person,

23:06.270 --> 23:06.790
but Su Yu

23:06.790 --> 23:07.790
is nothing good either.

23:08.160 --> 23:09.160
Is he worthy of trust?

23:10.270 --> 23:11.790
The spiritual materials he arrogantly sent

23:11.790 --> 23:12.400
are useless

23:12.750 --> 23:13.960
and even detrimental to Ranran's cultivation.

23:15.030 --> 23:16.880
Can't you just explain it nicely?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.640
Why do you have to make it seem like

23:18.880 --> 23:20.160
you and Ranran will never interact with each other again?

23:21.490 --> 23:21.970
Indeed.

23:22.830 --> 23:24.110
Ranran has her own life to live.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.110
I have my own path to follow too.

23:27.000 --> 23:28.400
We were always destined to go on

23:28.440 --> 23:28.960
two different paths.

23:38.650 --> 23:41.410
[Sovereign of Wester Sect] [Mu Qingge] [Xue Ranran]

24:21.920 --> 24:22.510
Bai.

24:23.550 --> 24:24.310
Thank you.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.240
I'm fine now.

24:27.790 --> 24:29.200
One shouldn't trap oneself.

24:29.680 --> 24:30.720
We must always move forward

24:31.510 --> 24:32.790
and do what needs to be done, right?

24:37.330 --> 24:38.130
I'll set off tomorrow

24:38.160 --> 24:39.310
to Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

24:40.680 --> 24:41.270
I've made

24:41.270 --> 24:42.310
enough spiritual pills for you.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.960
They're with Mr. Yu Tong.

24:45.030 --> 24:46.200
Remember to take them daily

24:46.720 --> 24:47.480
to replenish your spiritual power.

25:03.830 --> 25:04.790
Guardian, a visitor has arrived.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.720
I was escorting Hollow Sect disciples to Heavenly Meridian Mountain

25:13.240 --> 25:14.270
and passed by your place.

25:16.720 --> 25:17.200
Have a seat.

25:25.350 --> 25:26.160
Actually...

25:28.310 --> 25:29.880
Actually, I'm here to see her.

25:32.020 --> 25:33.390
She goes by Xue Ranran now, right?

25:35.480 --> 25:36.310
I mean no harm.

25:37.070 --> 25:38.270
I've known from the beginning

25:38.690 --> 25:40.080
that the Mu Qingge born on Mount Absolute

25:40.110 --> 25:40.790
was a fake.

25:42.440 --> 25:43.270
All this time,

25:43.750 --> 25:44.720
I've been watching her.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.400
And it's obvious

25:47.310 --> 25:48.480
who you, Su Yishui,

25:49.750 --> 25:50.480
have been protecting.

25:51.880 --> 25:52.480
So?

25:54.250 --> 25:54.690
Technically,

25:54.720 --> 25:55.560
I should report this

25:55.590 --> 25:56.750
to the sovereigns of all sects.

25:57.650 --> 25:58.640
They're eager to find out

25:58.640 --> 25:59.510
the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring.

26:00.590 --> 26:01.790
And the real Mu Qingge

26:01.790 --> 26:02.680
is the key.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.640
But don't worry,

26:05.590 --> 26:06.510
I haven't told anyone.

26:07.440 --> 26:08.960
The Spirit Spring has nothing to do with her.

26:09.510 --> 26:10.480
The Spirit Spring is in me.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.240
I will seal it back to the netherworld.

26:15.160 --> 26:16.440
You're quite frank with me.

26:17.480 --> 26:18.880
The Heavenly Sects still want the Spirit Spring.

26:19.480 --> 26:20.440
Troubling her would be pointless.

26:21.160 --> 26:22.000
You don't need to see her either.

26:22.710 --> 26:23.950
She's not Mu Qingge anymore.

26:28.920 --> 26:30.550
Nineteen years ago, I knew

26:31.270 --> 26:32.430
your reason for reviving her

26:32.790 --> 26:34.240
wasn't to break your own curse.

26:35.550 --> 26:36.280
Nor was it for any

26:36.310 --> 26:37.270
of the reasons you mentioned.

26:41.680 --> 26:42.400
You love her.

26:47.880 --> 26:49.550
That's something I've known even longer.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.480
That's why I was so jealous

26:53.920 --> 26:55.270
that I tried to drive a wedge between you two

26:56.270 --> 26:57.720
and lied about her disfiguring me.

26:59.070 --> 26:59.790
But...

27:01.880 --> 27:03.160
Everyone believed it.

27:05.830 --> 27:06.590
Except for you.

27:08.030 --> 27:08.720
Because she would never

27:08.720 --> 27:09.750
stoop so low.

27:14.110 --> 27:15.310
So I thought it through.

27:16.960 --> 27:18.790
What I tried to seize before,

27:19.550 --> 27:21.000
what I've been waiting for all this time,

27:22.550 --> 27:23.350
should've been let go long ago.

27:26.790 --> 27:28.030
Regarding the Spirit Spring,

27:28.750 --> 27:29.970
if you're willing to trust me,

27:30.000 --> 27:31.070
-I can help you—
-No need.

27:32.790 --> 27:33.550
I've heard that

27:34.440 --> 27:35.480
for the key to open the netherworld,

27:35.510 --> 27:36.030
one must wait

27:36.050 --> 27:37.050
for a specific time.

27:37.960 --> 27:38.680
Or do you

27:39.480 --> 27:41.110
have another passage to reach the netherworld?

27:42.830 --> 27:43.270
Oh, right.

27:43.880 --> 27:44.960
Did Mu Qingge already find

27:45.480 --> 27:46.350
that passage

27:46.350 --> 27:47.200
back then?

27:49.440 --> 27:50.160
What do you know?

27:52.750 --> 27:54.200
I was young and impetuous back then.

27:55.220 --> 27:56.400
I secretly followed her

27:56.420 --> 27:57.050
for a while.

28:07.830 --> 28:08.920
Xuantian Teachings?

28:10.830 --> 28:12.350
Why is this demoness looking for a passage

28:12.350 --> 28:13.000
to the netherworld?

28:15.790 --> 28:16.720
But I didn't follow her for long

28:16.750 --> 28:17.550
before I lost her.

28:18.000 --> 28:19.350
Later, demons ran rampant.

28:22.680 --> 28:23.880
It's all in the past now.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.200
Xuantian Teachings?

28:30.790 --> 28:31.200
Guardian,

28:32.000 --> 28:32.920
my brother and I have searched through

28:32.920 --> 28:33.880
the catalog and library.

28:34.530 --> 28:35.610
Mount Wester originally housed

28:35.640 --> 28:36.550
the Xuantian Teachings,

28:37.880 --> 28:39.790
but 19 years ago, after you went into seclusion,

28:40.510 --> 28:41.640
Su Yu came to claim

28:41.640 --> 28:42.440
Mu Qingge's belongings.

28:42.920 --> 28:43.790
He took some things with him.

28:44.350 --> 28:45.200
The Xuantian Teachings

28:45.480 --> 28:46.160
was among them.

28:48.030 --> 28:49.240
Does the Xuantian Teachings

28:49.550 --> 28:50.270
really contain information about

28:50.270 --> 28:51.270
another passage to the netherworld?

28:52.440 --> 28:54.400
But the Xuantian Teachings has existed for a century.

28:54.750 --> 28:55.270
How come no one

28:55.310 --> 28:56.310
had discovered it before?

28:59.040 --> 29:00.520
We'll know once we get

29:00.550 --> 29:01.200
the Xuantian Teachings.

29:02.270 --> 29:03.590
It seems after the Marrow-Cleansing Conference,

29:04.960 --> 29:06.480
I must go visit Su Yu.

29:10.890 --> 29:11.760
We're going to

29:11.790 --> 29:13.200
Heavenly Meridian Mountain for the trial today.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.590
Will Master really not give us some advice?

29:16.830 --> 29:18.310
Regardless of Master's intentions,

29:18.830 --> 29:19.920
as disciples, we should show

29:19.920 --> 29:20.480
proper respect.

29:24.030 --> 29:24.960
I, Disciple Xue Ranran,

29:25.310 --> 29:27.110
am setting off to Heavenly Meridian Mountain with my fellow disciples.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.030
I've come to inform you, Master.

29:29.920 --> 29:31.270
After I enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

29:31.510 --> 29:32.510
and form my Golden Core,

29:33.590 --> 29:34.960
I'll return to perform the graduation ceremony

29:35.480 --> 29:36.400
and bid farewell to Mount Wester forever.

29:38.640 --> 29:39.200
Ranran, you...

29:39.920 --> 29:40.400
Ranran,

29:41.040 --> 29:42.240
I know you're upset,

29:42.640 --> 29:43.440
but if you speak without leaving

29:43.550 --> 29:45.000
any room for reconciliation because of this

29:45.310 --> 29:46.960
and put yourself in danger,

29:46.960 --> 29:47.640
wouldn't that

29:48.240 --> 29:49.200
make people even more worried?

29:51.550 --> 29:52.790
I've been reflecting these days

29:53.400 --> 29:54.280
and I've realized

29:55.200 --> 29:56.310
our Master is very good to us.

29:57.030 --> 29:58.030
Don't say things out of anger anymore.

30:00.110 --> 30:00.960
Thank you, Seniors,

30:01.750 --> 30:02.880
but I've made up my mind.

30:03.750 --> 30:05.180
I must enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

30:07.910 --> 30:08.820
-Master.
-Master.

30:09.750 --> 30:11.550
If you can enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool and form a Golden Core,

30:12.030 --> 30:13.350
I wouldn't force such a capable disciple

30:13.720 --> 30:14.680
to stay.

30:17.110 --> 30:17.960
It's just a pity that

30:18.200 --> 30:19.350
you don't have such ability.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.640
Take more magical tools and talismans,

30:28.790 --> 30:29.750
lest you fail to graduate

30:30.000 --> 30:30.880
and become a laughingstock.

30:36.680 --> 30:37.350
Thank you, Master.

30:38.350 --> 30:39.230
Thank you, Master.

30:48.900 --> 30:49.850
This Marrow-Cleansing Pool

30:49.880 --> 30:50.880
is not something anyone can enter.

30:50.960 --> 30:51.720
Are you so confident

30:51.750 --> 30:52.680
that Master can make it through?

30:53.550 --> 30:54.350
I have my own arrangements.

30:54.750 --> 30:55.360
What arrangements?

30:55.720 --> 30:56.240
Seclusion.

30:57.120 --> 30:57.710
Seclusion?

30:58.640 --> 30:59.880
Master is taking a risk and you're going into seclusion?

31:00.320 --> 31:00.970
Are you heartless,

31:01.000 --> 31:01.400
Su Yishui?

31:05.640 --> 31:06.270
Su Yishui!

31:12.390 --> 31:16.120
[Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

31:21.110 --> 31:22.200
Heavenly Meridian Mountain is just ahead.

31:22.440 --> 31:23.120
We've arrived.

31:29.110 --> 31:30.480
You don't need to worry about my affairs.

31:30.750 --> 31:31.960
Even if I leave Mount Wester,

31:32.120 --> 31:33.610
we'll still be fellow disciples for life.

31:35.370 --> 31:35.980
You're leaving

31:36.010 --> 31:37.120
because of Master, right?

31:40.640 --> 31:41.920
Whether it is or isn't doesn't matter.

31:42.400 --> 31:43.240
I never intended

31:43.240 --> 31:44.160
to become a Heavenly expert.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.880
Isn't it better to enjoy life's pleasures?

31:46.240 --> 31:46.750
Besides,

31:47.240 --> 31:48.760
we haven't even seen the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

31:49.400 --> 31:50.960
Isn't it ridiculous to be so gloomy about it?

31:53.400 --> 31:54.160
According to the old rules,

31:54.680 --> 31:55.400
the first to find

31:55.400 --> 31:56.720
the Marrow-Cleansing Pool on Heavenly Meridian Mountain

31:57.000 --> 31:57.720
is the winner.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.410
However, the Heavenly Meridian Mountain

31:59.440 --> 32:01.270
is under the restrictions of the great Dun Tian,

32:01.720 --> 32:02.790
so we can't fly on swords

32:03.110 --> 32:05.030
or use teleportation techniques.

32:05.640 --> 32:06.030
Moreover,

32:06.400 --> 32:07.960
the sovereigns and elders of each sect

32:08.270 --> 32:09.440
have already entered Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

32:09.960 --> 32:10.440
Therefore,

32:11.590 --> 32:13.240
they can't enter again to protect their disciples.

32:14.790 --> 32:15.790
I've researched the ancient texts.

32:16.480 --> 32:17.480
This Marrow-Cleansing Pool wasn't

32:17.510 --> 32:18.480
in the mortal world before.

32:18.880 --> 32:19.880
It was in a secret area of the Immortal Realm.

32:20.450 --> 32:21.320
It was discovered by

32:21.350 --> 32:22.750
Dun Tian, the founder of the Eternal Sect.

32:23.000 --> 32:24.640
He greatly increased his cultivation by cleansing his marrow here,

32:24.960 --> 32:26.270
which later allowed him to attain ascension.

32:26.720 --> 32:28.510
After his ascension, he deliberately opened this place,

32:28.750 --> 32:30.240
making it accessible once every 19 years.

32:30.590 --> 32:32.440
That's how the Marrow-Cleansing Pool became this blessed land.

32:32.470 --> 32:33.000
Fortunately, this place

32:33.030 --> 32:34.070
is controlled by the righteous Heavenly Sects.

32:35.000 --> 32:35.960
Even if we don't succeed,

32:36.590 --> 32:38.000
it shouldn't be too dangerous.

32:38.680 --> 32:40.240
We need to be extremely careful.

32:40.680 --> 32:42.240
Since it's controlled by the Heavenly sects,

32:42.480 --> 32:43.880
demonic cultivators shouldn't be able to enter.

32:44.110 --> 32:45.000
Isn't it a bit excessive

32:45.350 --> 32:46.750
to be so cautious?

32:47.160 --> 32:48.920
One can only enter Heavenly Meridian Mountain once in a lifetime.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.480
And once you enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool,

32:51.830 --> 32:53.510
it's equivalent to skipping half a lifetime of arduous cultivation.

32:54.160 --> 32:55.750
Under such competition and temptation,

32:56.160 --> 32:57.310
anything can happen.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.450
Mu Qingge

33:03.640 --> 33:04.310
has such high cultivation

33:04.310 --> 33:05.270
and she's still competing for the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

33:05.720 --> 33:06.750
She's so vicious.

33:07.720 --> 33:08.720
After all, she's reborn.

33:08.880 --> 33:09.920
She's never entered Heavenly Meridian Mountain before,

33:10.030 --> 33:10.510
so

33:10.680 --> 33:11.510
it's not against the rules.

33:37.270 --> 33:37.830
Ranran.

33:41.960 --> 33:42.440
Be careful!

34:02.550 --> 34:03.200
Are you alright?

34:06.110 --> 34:07.260
These vines suck blood.

34:07.690 --> 34:08.449
We don't know how many

34:08.480 --> 34:09.400
blood-sucking vines are ahead.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.360
How are we going to get through?

34:14.630 --> 34:15.590
Come to me!

34:17.000 --> 34:17.540
Quickly.

34:24.400 --> 34:25.510
Watch out for these vines!

34:28.510 --> 34:29.360
Who is that person?

34:29.760 --> 34:30.550
Why is he using demonic magic?

34:31.150 --> 34:32.070
I heard he's the new disciple

34:32.070 --> 34:33.000
of Lingdi Sect

34:33.710 --> 34:34.670
named Gui Baqian.

34:35.489 --> 34:36.810
I've never heard before that

34:36.840 --> 34:38.030
there was such a figure in the Heavenly Sect.

34:38.670 --> 34:39.630
The main peak is just ahead.

34:40.070 --> 34:40.870
Let's put in more effort.

34:42.150 --> 34:42.480
Let's go.

34:49.230 --> 34:49.760
I can't go on.

34:50.280 --> 34:51.190
This is a matter of life and death.

34:51.590 --> 34:52.510
I can't hold on anymore.

34:53.400 --> 34:54.070
The Marrow-Cleansing Pool

34:54.400 --> 34:55.670
is just ahead on the main peak.

35:08.030 --> 35:08.960
But right in front of us

35:09.630 --> 35:11.110
is such a wide cliff.

35:11.760 --> 35:13.190
My spiritual power is almost exhausted

35:13.800 --> 35:15.230
and we're faced with this cliff.

35:15.890 --> 35:16.410
Since we can't fly on our swords,

35:16.440 --> 35:17.440
how can we get across?

35:20.230 --> 35:21.960
If I use all my power to control Divine Tree,

35:22.800 --> 35:24.400
I can form a bridge for us to cross.

35:25.480 --> 35:25.840
Ranran,

35:26.390 --> 35:27.510
do you have any strength left?

35:28.370 --> 35:29.120
Let's give it a try and see.

35:58.520 --> 35:59.280
It worked!

35:59.920 --> 36:01.320
Now if I use spiritual power to stabilize myself,

36:01.760 --> 36:02.550
I can cross.

36:35.320 --> 36:35.840
Ranran!

37:10.960 --> 37:11.550
Come to me!

37:11.880 --> 37:12.710
You can make it!

37:14.160 --> 37:15.040
Forget it, Ranran.

37:15.850 --> 37:17.180
I was lucky to make it through

37:17.210 --> 37:18.100
the previous checkpoints.

37:18.190 --> 37:19.670
I really don't have the strength to go any further.

37:20.440 --> 37:21.510
I've gained enough experience.

37:21.880 --> 37:22.630
The journey wasn't in vain.

37:23.290 --> 37:24.460
I'll stop here.

37:25.670 --> 37:27.280
Since Xi'er is staying here,

37:28.000 --> 37:29.230
I'll stay here to keep her company.

37:30.110 --> 37:31.320
I'm under punishment.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.400
I was never destined for the Marrow-Cleansing Pool anyway.

37:34.400 --> 37:36.040
Being able to come and see Heavenly Meridian Mountain

37:36.070 --> 37:37.190
is already great.

37:37.670 --> 37:38.190
Ranran,

37:39.030 --> 37:40.030
be careful on your journey.

37:45.920 --> 37:47.000
Wait for me to come back!

37:47.630 --> 37:48.280
Ranran,

37:49.070 --> 37:50.480
if it's too dangerous, just forget about it.

37:50.730 --> 37:51.610
You don't need to complete your training.

37:52.030 --> 37:53.030
Eating and drinking on Mount Wester

37:53.030 --> 37:53.950
is good enough.

37:59.700 --> 38:03.760
[Main Peak Cave of Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

38:01.110 --> 38:01.520
Senior,

38:01.550 --> 38:02.280
I found this sword first!

38:02.300 --> 38:02.880
Get out of my way!

38:02.920 --> 38:04.030
If I see it, it's mine!

38:04.190 --> 38:05.070
The main peak

38:05.800 --> 38:06.920
has heavenly treasures everywhere.

38:07.670 --> 38:08.630
The great Dun Tian left countless treasures

38:08.630 --> 38:09.710
in this cave.

38:10.150 --> 38:11.360
It's just a mirror.

38:11.510 --> 38:12.590
Why bother fighting with your sister over it?

38:12.800 --> 38:14.360
Why don't you choose another treasure instead?

38:15.480 --> 38:16.510
We came to Heavenly Meridian Mountain

38:16.840 --> 38:17.710
for the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

38:18.630 --> 38:20.190
Why has everyone forgotten our original purpose

38:20.210 --> 38:21.360
and started fighting over other things?

38:25.710 --> 38:26.150
Give it to me!

38:26.230 --> 38:26.710
Don't run!

38:28.150 --> 38:28.550
It's mine!

38:28.710 --> 38:29.590
Give it to me! It's mine!

38:40.150 --> 38:40.710
Why is there

38:40.710 --> 38:41.880
a little bird tied up here?

38:42.360 --> 38:43.440
Its feet are all chafed.

38:44.480 --> 38:46.110
Did the great Dun Tian tie you up?

38:47.070 --> 38:47.880
Little bird, wait a moment.

38:48.150 --> 38:49.030
I'll help stop the bleeding right away.

38:49.710 --> 38:50.840
You have a good eye.

38:53.490 --> 38:54.890
There are many treasures on the main peak

38:54.920 --> 38:55.880
of Heavenly Meridian Mountain,

38:56.320 --> 38:58.150
but this Vermilion Bird is the most precious of all.

38:58.680 --> 38:59.890
It is the most powerful

38:59.920 --> 39:01.550
purifying and demon-expelling divine object in the world.

39:02.190 --> 39:03.480
You're indeed clever.

39:03.960 --> 39:05.670
You know to fight for the most valuable thing.

39:06.590 --> 39:08.070
I don't understand what you're talking about.

39:08.920 --> 39:10.030
You always have this

39:10.030 --> 39:11.070
lofty air,

39:11.840 --> 39:12.590
but in reality,

39:12.850 --> 39:13.890
you hold onto all the benefits

39:13.920 --> 39:14.800
and refuse to let go.

39:15.440 --> 39:17.000
It truly makes me sick.

39:17.480 --> 39:19.000
You really love to talk to yourself.

39:19.400 --> 39:20.480
I'd like to ask you

39:21.010 --> 39:22.120
why you're so obsessed with replacing

39:22.150 --> 39:23.070
Mu Qingge's identity.

39:23.320 --> 39:24.550
Is this false reputation really that good?

39:25.070 --> 39:25.800
Where have you hidden

39:25.800 --> 39:26.670
the Grandmaster?

39:28.320 --> 39:28.960
You're asking me?

39:30.030 --> 39:31.440
You should ask your Master about that.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.190
He loves Mu Qingge so much,

39:33.510 --> 39:34.710
if anyone's hiding her, it's him.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.040
Besides,

39:36.070 --> 39:37.760
with his autocratic nature,

39:38.040 --> 39:38.640
he wouldn't bear

39:38.670 --> 39:39.880
to hide Mu Qingge too far away.

39:40.190 --> 39:40.840
Perhaps

39:41.440 --> 39:42.360
she's hidden right by his side.

39:44.150 --> 39:44.920
Cut the nonsense.

39:45.280 --> 39:46.150
Give me the Vermilion Bird.

39:53.240 --> 39:53.720
Vermilion Bird,

39:53.790 --> 39:54.390
you escape first.

39:57.030 --> 39:57.840
Everything in this cave

39:57.840 --> 39:58.760
arouses people's greed.

39:59.070 --> 40:00.150
Now that the Vermilion Bird has flown away,

40:00.550 --> 40:01.920
Master Mu, you can come to your senses.

40:02.150 --> 40:03.150
I'm perfectly clear-headed.

40:03.280 --> 40:03.920
When you're preaching

40:03.960 --> 40:04.800
your morals, I'm even more

40:04.840 --> 40:05.760
clear-headed.

40:06.030 --> 40:06.960
Today is perfect timing.

40:07.230 --> 40:08.710
So many people die on Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

40:09.010 --> 40:10.290
Su Yishui won't know

40:10.320 --> 40:10.920
the truth.

40:11.000 --> 40:12.070
Why don't I choose today

40:12.280 --> 40:13.480
to fulfill my wish?

40:27.670 --> 40:28.760
Bai, how did you get here?

40:30.880 --> 40:32.030
This technique is...

40:32.110 --> 40:32.670
Master?

40:44.960 --> 40:46.670
Bai used Master's technique.

40:47.110 --> 40:48.190
Is it the Soul Control Technique?

40:49.000 --> 40:50.620
Could it be that Master listened to what I said

40:51.010 --> 40:52.330
and believed that Mu Qingge was fake,

40:52.360 --> 40:53.270
so he possessed Bai?

40:54.630 --> 40:55.070
No,

40:55.440 --> 40:56.590
I need to know how Master is doing.

41:05.840 --> 41:06.280
Senior,

41:06.960 --> 41:07.630
please guide me

41:07.970 --> 41:08.770
on how to return to

41:08.800 --> 41:09.670
the main peak of Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

41:10.070 --> 41:11.350
My Master is fighting with someone evil.

41:11.550 --> 41:12.110
I'm worried about him.

41:13.400 --> 41:15.280
You're concerned about your own Master,

41:16.280 --> 41:17.920
but what about other people's herbs?

41:22.800 --> 41:23.360
I'm sorry,

41:23.880 --> 41:24.800
I was in a hurry.

41:25.710 --> 41:26.150
How about this?

41:26.400 --> 41:27.400
I'm skilled in wood-based magic.

41:27.720 --> 41:28.600
I can help you grow a few

41:28.630 --> 41:29.730
thousand-year-old herbs as an apology.

41:30.120 --> 41:30.850
Please tell me

41:30.880 --> 41:31.920
how I can get back.

41:32.590 --> 41:34.000
As a cultivator, you should know

41:34.630 --> 41:36.000
everything happens for a reason.

41:36.840 --> 41:38.000
We have no predestined connection.

41:39.440 --> 41:40.280
I can't help you.

41:43.880 --> 41:45.440
How can we not have a connection?

41:45.920 --> 41:47.220
The Alcohol Immortal from Mount Cuiwei

41:47.360 --> 41:48.440
is my friend.

41:49.000 --> 41:49.760
Not long ago,

41:49.960 --> 41:51.320
I even helped him brew a few jars of fine wine.

41:52.550 --> 41:53.630
How do you know that

41:54.150 --> 41:55.360
I know Alcohol Immortal

41:56.190 --> 41:57.320
and how can you be sure

41:57.840 --> 41:58.590
that he and I

41:59.110 --> 42:00.320
are friends, not enemies?

42:01.450 --> 42:02.200
Your wine gourd

42:02.230 --> 42:03.440
is identical to Alcohol Immortal's.

42:03.920 --> 42:04.550
If you were enemies,

42:04.800 --> 42:06.030
why would you carry your enemy's wine gourd

42:06.050 --> 42:06.800
with you?

42:13.550 --> 42:14.590
You, young lady,

42:15.280 --> 42:16.280
are quite clever.

42:17.150 --> 42:17.840
You're right.

42:18.310 --> 42:19.830
Alcohol Immortal is my younger brother.

42:20.070 --> 42:21.190
I am the Medicine Immortal.

42:20.160 --> 42:21.130
[Medicine Immortal]

42:21.790 --> 42:22.760
Since that's the case,

42:23.360 --> 42:24.590
I'll put your mind at ease.

42:29.110 --> 42:30.190
Every time there's a trial,

42:31.320 --> 42:32.400
when they reach this Treasure Cave,

42:33.480 --> 42:34.550
the participants can't resist

42:34.570 --> 42:36.130
the temptation of these heavenly treasures.

42:37.030 --> 42:38.070
The higher their cultivation,

42:38.630 --> 42:39.920
the more they want to claim

42:39.920 --> 42:40.630
the best for themselves.

42:41.710 --> 42:42.630
The barrier of greed

42:43.600 --> 42:45.000
is truly difficult to overcome.

42:46.480 --> 42:47.710
Isn't that too harsh?

42:48.230 --> 42:49.360
Failing and being sent away

42:49.360 --> 42:49.920
is enough.

42:50.280 --> 42:51.320
Why take their lives?

42:52.510 --> 42:53.400
Cultivating spiritual power

42:53.670 --> 42:54.670
to achieve immortality

42:55.440 --> 42:57.030
is already defying the natural order.

42:57.880 --> 42:59.150
If one wants to enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

42:59.770 --> 43:01.420
to gain instant benefits,

43:02.280 --> 43:04.110
they must bear the corresponding risks.

43:04.550 --> 43:05.510
Then, my Master...

43:07.840 --> 43:09.110
This must be your Master, right?

43:20.070 --> 43:21.110
Indeed, it's Master's technique.

43:21.800 --> 43:23.040
Master did use the Soul Control Technique

43:23.070 --> 43:24.150
to possess Bai's body.
